request.body:
To {{source_name}},

I am a New Jersey resident. Under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}), I request that you:

1. Delete the personal data you hold about me.
2. Stop selling my personal data, and stop processing it for targeted advertising and profiling.

Details to identify my record (please use them only for this request):
Name: {{full_name}}
Address shown on your site: {{address}}
Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}
Contact email for this request: {{email}}

If you need more information to verify that this request comes from me, please tell me what you need. The law asks for a response within {{response_days}} days of receiving a verified request. If you need more time, please tell me within that period and explain why. If you decline any part of this request, please tell me why and how I can appeal.

Please confirm in writing when the deletion is complete.

Thank you,
{{full_name}}
{{date}}

followUp.body:
To {{source_name}},

I am following up on my request under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}) to delete my personal data and stop selling it.

Request sent on: {{sent_date}}
Response period ended on: {{due_date}}
Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}

I have not received a response, an extension notice or a decision I can appeal. Please complete the deletion and confirm in writing, or tell me why you cannot and how I can appeal. If I do not hear from you, I may file a complaint with the New Jersey Division of Consumer Affairs.

{{full_name}}
{{date}}

complaint.body:
I am a New Jersey resident. I asked {{source_name}} ({{source_website}}) to delete my personal data and stop selling it, under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}). As far as I can tell, the company did not complete or answer the request within the response period. I ask the Division to review it.

Request sent on: {{sent_date}}
Response period ended on: {{due_date}}
Listing still shown on: {{recheck_date}}
Listing address: {{profile_url}}

I can provide a copy of my request, its date, and screenshots of the listing taken before the request and after the response period.

{{full_name}}
Contact email: {{email}}

